Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.24,0:07:38.06,stats,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs12\c&HFCFDFF&\fad(90,0)\t(90,257,\c&HFCFFDF&)\4c&HFAFE7F&\t(90,257,\4c&HB9C45F&)\3c&HFAFE7F&\t(90,257,\3c&HB9C45F&)\bord1.5\shad\pos(466.429,326.857)}حوري بحر
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.71,0:07:48.53,stats,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs9\c&HFCFDFF&\fad(90,0)\t(90,257,\c&HFCFFDF&)\4c&HFAFE7F&\t(90,257,\4c&HB9C45F&)\3c&HFAFE7F&\t(90,257,\3c&HB9C45F&)\bord1.5\shad\pos(160.714,70.286)}قوم الأفاعي
